From: Ran Wang <wangra@google.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:01:24 -0400
Subject: D3D11: Fix source coordinate clamping in StretchedBlitNearest

Clamp interpolated source rows against sourceSize.height - 1 instead
of sourceArea.height - 1 in StretchedBlitNearest_RowByRow, and avoid
dividing by zero when destination width or height is one.

Test: angle_end2end_tests --gtest_filter="*DepthStencilSubImageNonZeroOffset*"
Bug: b/575937643
Change-Id: I96bbf2daf1d5c683256c57125b3fc638e7ac25ae
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/8663781
Reviewed-by: Yuxin Hu <yuxinhu@google.com>
Reviewed-by: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Shahbaz Youssefi <syoussefi@chromium.org>

